# ==============================================================================
# VyaparSnap: Single Central Supabase Backend Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# ARCHITECTURE NOTE:
# VyaparSnap uses ONE central Supabase project for the entire platform.
# Individual vendors/shopkeepers NEVER configure databases or API keys.
# Multi-tenancy is handled automatically via Supabase Row-Level Security (RLS).
#
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS FOR DEVELOPER / DEPLOYER:
# 1. Create 1 Supabase project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Go to SQL Editor and run the script in: ./supabase_schema.sql
# 3. Copy your Project URL & Anon Key from: Project Settings -> API
# 4. Paste them below (or set them in Vercel / Netlify / Cloudflare Pages environment variables):
# ==============================================================================

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-central-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
